WEBVTT

00:00:06.545 --> 00:00:08.305
(PLAYER SCREAMS)

00:00:08.385 --> 00:00:10.265
(TIRES SCREECHING)

00:00:10.705 --> 00:00:12.425
Power drift into a drift jump!

00:00:12.585 --> 00:00:14.705
I saw it! You're amazing!

00:00:14.785 --> 00:00:15.825
Thank you.

00:00:24.905 --> 00:00:27.945
ARTHUR:
Scanning for insecurities.

00:00:32.025 --> 00:00:34.705
Looks like we're not finished.
Come on, V.

00:00:37.105 --> 00:00:38.105
Ralph?

00:00:38.545 --> 00:00:39.745
(BRAKES SCREECHING)

00:00:43.465 --> 00:00:44.505
Huh.

00:00:44.585 --> 00:00:46.905
Okay. Relax. Relax!

00:00:47.105 --> 00:00:48.425
I'll just call him
after the race.

00:00:48.505 --> 00:00:49.505
It'll be okay.

00:00:49.905 --> 00:00:51.305
(GLITCHES) Ralph will be fine.

00:00:52.745 --> 00:00:54.145
ARTHUR: Insecurity detected.

00:00:55.905 --> 00:00:57.305
Copying insecurity.

00:01:00.905 --> 00:01:03.105
Distributing insecurity.

00:01:03.265 --> 00:01:05.265
Distributing insecurity.

00:01:05.345 --> 00:01:08.825
Distributing insecurity.
Distributing...

00:01:08.905 --> 00:01:11.825
(GASPING) What is happening?

00:01:17.545 --> 00:01:18.865
RALPH:
What's going on, Spamley?

00:01:19.025 --> 00:01:20.705
The whole place
is going crazy.

00:01:20.865 --> 00:01:22.945
I thought that virus was just
supposed to slow down her car.

00:01:23.105 --> 00:01:24.105
It was.

00:01:24.225 --> 00:01:26.065
It must've found something
real unstable in there.

00:01:27.705 --> 00:01:29.345
It's her glitch.

00:01:29.785 --> 00:01:31.225
ANNOUNCER: Game reboot begins

00:01:31.305 --> 00:01:32.545
in 60 seconds.

00:01:32.905 --> 00:01:34.745
Whoa, hey! Hey, Ralph,
you can't go in there.

00:01:34.945 --> 00:01:36.025
They're gonna
reboot the game...

00:01:36.105 --> 00:01:37.185
and anything that doesn't
belong in there

00:01:37.265 --> 00:01:38.265
will be deleted.

00:01:38.345 --> 00:01:39.825
Yeah, and if I don't get her
outta there,

00:01:39.945 --> 00:01:41.465
Vanellope's gonna die!

00:01:43.865 --> 00:01:46.025
Come on, kid.
The game's crashing. Let's go.

00:01:46.185 --> 00:01:47.385
I think it's my glitch.

00:01:47.545 --> 00:01:50.465
I'm sorry, I didn't mean to
destroy your game.

00:01:50.665 --> 00:01:53.505
We'll be fine, but your code
isn't part of this game.

00:01:53.745 --> 00:01:56.745
We got to get you out of here
now. Follow me to the exit.

00:02:02.305 --> 00:02:03.625
(GASPS)

00:02:05.465 --> 00:02:07.305
Oh, no, no!

00:02:07.385 --> 00:02:08.745
(TIRES SCREECHING)

00:02:13.865 --> 00:02:14.905
RALPH: Kid!

00:02:15.025 --> 00:02:16.385
Kid, where are you?

00:02:17.145 --> 00:02:19.185
SHANK: The server
is rebooting, Ralph.

00:02:19.345 --> 00:02:21.265
Both of you have to
get out of here now.

00:02:21.425 --> 00:02:22.665
Kid, I got you. I got you.

00:02:24.505 --> 00:02:25.745
-(ALARM BLARING)
-ANNOUNCER: Game reboot...

00:02:25.945 --> 00:02:29.505
in five, four, three...

00:02:29.665 --> 00:02:31.505
-two, one.
-(BANGING)

00:02:31.585 --> 00:02:33.345
(RALPH GRUNTS, PANTING)

00:02:33.785 --> 00:02:35.785
ANNOUNCER: Reboot in progress.

00:02:39.225 --> 00:02:41.105
Come on, Vanellope. Wake up.

00:02:41.265 --> 00:02:43.385
Come on. Don't leave me, kid.

00:02:43.465 --> 00:02:44.865
(RASPY BREATHING)

00:02:46.105 --> 00:02:47.265
Ralph?

00:02:47.425 --> 00:02:50.225
Oh. There you are.
You okay, kid?

00:02:50.945 --> 00:02:54.265
Ralph, I messed up so bad.

00:02:54.425 --> 00:02:56.545
No. No, you didn't, it's okay.

00:02:56.905 --> 00:02:59.585
This is all because of me
and my glitch.

00:03:00.025 --> 00:03:01.705
I should've
just stayed with you...

00:03:01.905 --> 00:03:04.705
instead of following
some stupid dream.

00:03:04.785 --> 00:03:06.265
(SOBBING)

00:03:06.345 --> 00:03:08.545
I've ruined everything.

00:03:08.985 --> 00:03:10.785
No, kid, no.

00:03:12.505 --> 00:03:16.265
Ah, look. I didn't mean
for it to happen like this.

00:03:16.425 --> 00:03:19.425
It was not supposed
to be this bad.

00:03:19.945 --> 00:03:21.065
(SNIFFLES)

00:03:22.145 --> 00:03:24.785
You didn't mean
for what to happen?

00:03:25.105 --> 00:03:28.785
I mighta,
kinda sorta put a...

00:03:30.065 --> 00:03:32.985
harmless little virus
in the game.

00:03:33.185 --> 00:03:35.225
A virus?

00:03:35.385 --> 00:03:37.585
You did this?

00:03:37.745 --> 00:03:39.785
I wouldn't have done anything

00:03:39.865 --> 00:03:41.105
if I hadn't heard you
tell Shank...

00:03:41.265 --> 00:03:43.185
that you wanted to live in
Slaughter Race forever.

00:03:43.265 --> 00:03:44.385
(GASPS)

00:03:44.465 --> 00:03:46.585
So you were spying on me?

00:03:46.785 --> 00:03:48.785
Hey. You're not exactly
innocent here.

00:03:48.945 --> 00:03:51.425
You were gonna ditch everybody
and abandon Sugar Rush.

00:03:51.585 --> 00:03:54.985
Oh, please. I'm one of 16
racers. They'd never miss me.

00:03:55.145 --> 00:03:56.305
What about me?

00:03:56.465 --> 00:03:58.865
Why would I ever spend
another second with you...

00:03:59.025 --> 00:04:00.185
after what you did?

00:04:00.985 --> 00:04:01.985
(RALPH GASPS)

00:04:02.065 --> 00:04:03.545
No!

00:04:07.225 --> 00:04:08.745
No.

00:04:09.425 --> 00:04:10.945
Vanellope,
where are you going?

00:04:11.105 --> 00:04:12.385
Wherever you're not.

00:04:12.545 --> 00:04:13.545
Wait a minute. I can explain.

00:04:13.665 --> 00:04:15.585
No!
You will not follow me.

00:04:15.745 --> 00:04:16.745
Vanellope, please...

00:04:16.905 --> 00:04:19.705
A friend would never do
what you did. Never!

00:04:19.865 --> 00:04:22.145
So you leave me alone!

00:04:22.305 --> 00:04:24.785
Vanellope, no, no, no! Please!

00:04:24.985 --> 00:04:26.785
Please! What did I do?

00:04:27.545 --> 00:04:28.945
ARTHUR:
Scanning for insecurities.

00:04:29.105 --> 00:04:30.945
Vanellope, come on,
don't leave me!

00:04:31.785 --> 00:04:33.305
ARTHUR: Insecurity detected.

00:04:36.665 --> 00:04:39.385
-(BEEPING)
-Copying insecurity.

00:04:41.585 --> 00:04:43.665
Oh, no, no, no.

00:04:44.065 --> 00:04:45.985
ARTHUR:
Distributing insecurity.

00:04:52.585 --> 00:04:55.945
(PANTING)

00:04:56.025 --> 00:04:57.025
Come on.

00:04:57.505 --> 00:04:59.025
(GRUNTING)

00:04:59.625 --> 00:05:00.625
Where is it?

00:05:01.505 --> 00:05:02.745
(GRUNTS, PANTING)

00:05:03.265 --> 00:05:04.465
Ooh!

00:05:05.465 --> 00:05:07.265
(PANTING)

00:05:09.305 --> 00:05:10.385
Oh, no.

